# Copy to .env.local and fill in from Supabase → Project Settings → API.
# Both values here are the PUBLIC anon key and project URL — safe to ship to
# the browser. RLS is the security boundary, not this file.
#
# NEVER put the service-role key in any file under 02-SOURCE/frontend/, or in
# any VITE_-prefixed variable — Vite inlines every VITE_ var into the built
# bundle, shipping it to every browser that loads the app. The service-role
# key belongs only in the provision-employee Edge Function's own server-side
# environment (set via `supabase secrets set`, never a frontend .env file).

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
